Version: 1.1
desc: calfNXT Multiband Limiter
tags: dynamics limiter multiband mastering
author: chmaha
changelog:
  Moving a control in the plugin window now records automation and notifies REAPER (named slider fix).
about:
  A multiband lookahead limiter with 2 to 6 bands. Linkwitz-Riley crossovers (24, 48 or 96 dB/oct) split the signal;
  each band has its own lookahead limiter with a release scale and a weight, a shared multiband coefficient keeps the band
  sum under the limit, and a broadband limiter follows the band sum. Lookahead, release, minimum release, ASC, curve
  (Lin/Log/Cos), soft ceiling, colour, true peak with margin, release hold, emphasis, oversampling up to 4x, auto level,
  difference listen, band listen and mono. Constant latency (maximum lookahead) is reported to the host.
  Ported from the Multiband Limiter in calfNXT by Markus Schmidt (https://calfnxt.org), GNU GPL 3.
  JSFX version released under GPLv3 license
  Claude generated some of this code

slider1:g_bypass=0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Bypass
slider2:g_bands=4<2,6,1>-Bands
slider3:g_slope=48<24,96,1>-Slope (dB/oct)
slider4:g_x1=200<20,20000,0.1:log=632.5>-Crossover 1 (Hz)
slider5:g_x2=800<20,20000,0.1:log=632.5>-Crossover 2 (Hz)
slider6:g_x3=3200<20,20000,0.1:log=632.5>-Crossover 3 (Hz)
slider7:g_x4=8000<20,20000,0.1:log=632.5>-Crossover 4 (Hz)
slider8:g_x5=12000<20,20000,0.1:log=632.5>-Crossover 5 (Hz)
slider9:g_limit=0<-24,0,0.1>-Limit (dB)
slider10:g_attack=5<0.1,10,0.01:log=1>-Lookahead (ms)
slider11:g_release=50<1,1000,1:log=31.62>-Release (ms)
slider12:g_minrel=0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Min Release
slider13:g_asc=1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-ASC
slider14:g_asccoeff=0.5<0,1,0.01>-ASC Level
slider15:g_os=1<1,4,1>-Oversampling
slider16:g_auto=1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Auto Level
slider17:g_curve=0<0,2,1{Lin,Log,Cos}>-Curve
slider18:g_knee=0<0,12,0.1>-Soft Ceiling (dB)
slider19:g_cole=0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Color
slider20:g_col=0.35<0,1,0.01>-Color Amount
slider21:g_tp=0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-True Peak
slider22:g_margin=0.1<0,3,0.01>-TP Margin (dB)
slider23:g_diff=0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Diff Listen
slider24:g_holde=0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Hold
slider25:g_hold=25<0,500,1>-Release Hold (ms)
slider26:g_empe=0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Emphasis
slider27:g_emp=0.4<0,1,0.01>-Emphasis Amount
slider28:g_b0_lis=0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Band 1 Listen
slider29:g_b0_wt=0<-1,1,0.01>-Band 1 Weight
slider30:g_b0_rel=0.5<-1,1,0.01>-Band 1 Release
slider31:g_b1_lis=0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Band 2 Listen
slider32:g_b1_wt=0<-1,1,0.01>-Band 2 Weight
slider33:g_b1_rel=0.2<-1,1,0.01>-Band 2 Release
slider34:g_b2_lis=0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Band 3 Listen
slider35:g_b2_wt=0<-1,1,0.01>-Band 3 Weight
slider36:g_b2_rel=-0.2<-1,1,0.01>-Band 3 Release
slider37:g_b3_lis=0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Band 4 Listen
